# The Firebase service account key (a private key for sending push notifications).
# It is uploaded to Expo once and must never be committed. Keep it outside this folder;
# these lines are a safety net. (google-services.json is different: it holds no secret
# and is committed, see docs/APK_BUILD.md.)
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json

# OCR language data, downloaded on first use
*.traineddata
